atrix: the provider,\n53\t  dependency, and deployment combinations that are supported at GA (e.g.\n54\t  inference and vector/storage provider combinations the distribution is\n55\t  validated against), reflecting the GA scope and the platform architecture\n56\t  context.\n57\t- Review the posture documents with support and product stakeholders and\n58\t  publish them through the product's support-documentation channels.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- SLO targets are documented and published for the GA distribution.\n63\t- The backport policy is documented and published, covering supported\n64\t  release lines and backport request handling.\n65\t- The supported configuration matrix is published and covers every\n66\t  configuration the ratified GA scope declares supported; configurations\n67\t  outside the matrix are explicitly marked unsupported.\n68\t- The posture documents have been reviewed and accepted by support and\n69\t  product stakeholders.\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- **HLR-3 (P0)**: Production support posture is in place — documented SLO\n74\t  targets, backport policy, and supported configuration matrix. This epic is\n75\t  the direct deliverer of HLR-3.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9399e9c72dcd92ec","agent_id":"a92d6397dd8e68ae4","session_id":"bc08d67b-4a0e-4de8-9000-b947c2646aca","uuid":"6e94d4ec-6825-4f18-b23f-01cd63b2dcf7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:42:30.741Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9376f92922ba8243","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
