cs, including the guardrails integration\n55\t  and Dashboard management topics where they reference Llama Stack.\n56\t- **Accuracy validation** — every documented procedure, configuration\n57\t  reference, and API example validated against the implemented GA behavior\n58\t  and the platform architecture context before publication.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- The Llama Stack documentation set meets GA documentation standards as\n63\t  defined by the Red Hat docs content process.\n64\t- A migration guide exists covering upgrade from the last two Tech Preview\n65\t  releases, consistent with the tested upgrade path delivered by the\n66\t  stability work.\n67\t- No Llama Stack doc topic describes the component or its guardrails\n68\t  integration as Tech Preview or experimental where GA behavior has shipped.\n69\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented GA\n70\t  behavior (APIs, support posture, guardrails integration, Dashboard\n71\t  defaults) by engineering owners before publication.\n72\t- Documentation is published through the Red Hat docs content process.\n73\t\n74\t## HLR Traceability\n75\t\n76\t- **HLR-6 (P2)**: Documentation is uplifted to GA standards, including\n77\t  migration notes from TP. This epic is the direct deliverer of HLR-6.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9399e9c72dcd92ec","agent_id":"a92d6397dd8e68ae4","session_id":"bc08d67b-4a0e-4de8-9000-b947c2646aca","uuid":"a2df65fb-259e-404e-bdf2-87d60e2b0d31","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:42:35.023Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9dd596b43606a3e9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
