{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b62b39b379689bc9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9014-E005\n3\ttitle: Dashboard Llama Stack management enabled by default\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9014\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 0\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 8\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Dashboard Llama Stack management enabled by default\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic enables Llama Stack management in the Dashboard by default for\n34\tentitled clusters, removing the Tech Preview opt-in gate. Entitled users see\n35\tLlama Stack management surfaces without configuration, while the change stays\n36\tcontained to the Dashboard's existing feature-flag and entitlement\n37\tmechanisms.\n38\t\n39\t## Scope\n40\t\n41\t- Change the Dashboard feature default so Llama Stack management is enabled\n42\t  by default, driven by cluster entitlement (via the Dashboard's existing\n43\t  OdhDashboardConfig feature-flag mechanism).\n44\t- Remove the Tech Preview opt-in gate for Llama Stack management.\n45\t- Preserve an administrator path to disable Llama Stack management via the\n46\t  existing configuration mechanism (rollback/disable safety for the default\n47\t  flip).\n48\t- Update Dashboard tests covering default-on behavior for entitled clusters,\n49\t  unaffected behavior for non-entitled clusters, and the disable path.\n50\t- Incidental UI text/caption updates that fall out of the default flip are\n51\t  included here; no new doc topics are authored in this epic.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- On an entitled cluster with default configuration, Llama Stack management\n56\t  surfaces are visible and usable in the Dashboard with no opt-in step.\n57\t- On a non-entitled cluster, Llama Stack management remains hidden and no\n58\t  errors or degraded behavior result.\n59\t- An administrator can disable Llama Stack management through the existing\n60\t  configuration mechanism, and the disable is effective after reload.\n61\t- Regression tests cover the entitled default-on, non-entitled hidden, and\n62\t  administrator-disable paths, and pass.\n63\t- All changes merge through a green Konflux build pipeline for the Dashboard\n64\t  midstream repo.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- **HLR-5 (P1)**: The Dashboard enables Llama Stack management by default\n69\t  for entitled clusters (no TP opt-in gate). This epic is the direct\n70\t  deliverer of HLR-5.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83473cf1cf19135a","agent_id":"a0e56b6a1c5c0aca8","session_id":"bc08d67b-4a0e-4de8-9000-b947c2646aca","uuid":"2194f720-3060-4f47-aef4-e47de8d3cbbb","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:49:04.908Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b62b39b379689bc9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
